        <![CDATA[
<h2>Release Notes - 2024.2.13</h2>

<h3>New Features and Enhancements</h3>
<p>We are excited to announce the latest release of our service, introducing *Unlogged Premium*! Our premium plan offers a suite of advanced features designed to enhance your experience and boost productivity. Here's what's new:
</p>
