    <p>Leverage cutting-edge AI technology to help you debug your applications more efficiently and effectively.</p>
   </li>

   <li>
    <p><b>Save Unlimited Mocks and Tests</b></p>
    <p>Enjoy the freedom to save an unlimited number of mocks and tests, ensuring you can thoroughly test your applications without any limitations or hassles.</p>
   </li>

   <li>
    <p><b>Updates</b></p>
    <p>Stay ahead with exclusive updates and enhancements available only to premium users.</p>
   </li>

   <li>
    <p><b>Server-Side Recording and Replay</b></p>
    <p>Record and replay server-side interactions to diagnose issues and improve the performance of your applications.</p>
   </li>
</ol>

<h3>General Improvements:</h3>
<ol>
    <li>
        <p><b>Enhanced Performance</b></p>
        <p>We have made several performance improvements to ensure smoother and faster operation across the platform.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p><b>Bug Fixes</b></p>
        <p>Various bug fixes have been implemented to enhance stability and reliability.</p>
    </li>
</ol>

<h3>How to Upgrade:</h3>
<p>Upgrading to Unlogged Premium is simple. Start your subscription <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZeg1jc4I5UV1Gw146">here</a> </p>
